palmier-pro (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging of the Palmier Pro Linux port.
  * Multi-track timeline editor with GPU-accelerated decode/encode/effects.
  * Local MCP server and in-app agent chat over the shared tool surface.
  * Declares runtime dependencies on Qt 6, FFmpeg (libav*), the Vulkan loader,
    shaderc, libva, lcms2, and libsecret.

